<!--
  One country, AAA, a square from 1°W to 3°E and 1°S to 1°N, and one secondary road (60 km/h) along the
  equator from 0° to 2°E, drawn with a node every 0.1°.

  On the equator 0.1° is 11.12 km (the engine's sphere has a radius of 6371.0088 km), so the road is
  222.4 km long: 3.71 h at the wheel, 4.45 h of travel. Every 11.12 km of it takes 0.222 h of travel.

        1°N +-------------------------------------------+
            |                    AAA                    |
         0° |      1 . . . . . . 11 . . . . . . 21      |
            |      0°            1°E            2°E     |
        1°S +-------------------------------------------+
           1°W                                         3°E
-->
